The cost of an orchestration run is:

\[
C_{run}=C_{supervisor}
+\sum_{i=1}^{n}C_{specialist,i}
+C_{communication}
+C_{tools}
+C_{verification}
+C_{infra}
\]

Every nested agent can perform several model and tool calls.

